{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{"address":"38 W Victoria St, Ste 108","attributes":{"Ambience":{"casual":true,"classy":null,"divey":false,"hipster":false,"intimate":null,"romantic":false,"touristy":null,"trendy":null,"upscale":null},"BusinessParking":{"garage":true,"lot":true,"street":true,"valet":false,"validated":false},"Music":null,"OutdoorSeating":true,"RestaurantsGoodForGroups":null,"RestaurantsReservations":false,"RestaurantsTakeOut":true,"WiFi":"free"},"business_stars":4.5,"categories":"Restaurants, Vegan, Gluten-Free, Falafel, Mediterranean, Salad, Sandwiches","city":"Santa Barbara","hours":{"Friday":"11:30-21:30","Monday":"11:30-16:30","Saturday":"11:30-21:30","Sunday":"11:30-21:0","Thursday":"11:30-21:0","Tuesday":"11:30-21:0","Wednesday":"11:30-21:0"},"name":"Fala Bar","review_info":[{"review_date":"2022-01-17 18:04:33","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"I'm not vegan and this place was great, delicious and super satisfying.\n\nI had the avocado burger, and my friend had the kale burger.  We order a Brussels sprouts side, but the burgers are so plentiful we couldn't eat it all. We left feeling satisfied but not weighed down. \n\nThe guys working were really nice, and service was fast.  \n\nWe ended up eating at the market because it wasn't very crowded and it was just an over all great experience."},{"review_date":"2021-12-19 22:18:31","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"I love a good falafel sandwich. This was Top Notch! I ordered two spicy Falafel sandwiches. (I had one a couple days ago and zipped back for a repeat order. The falafel was actually spicy (vs salty spicy and spicy for wimps). It was crunchy in the outside and tender on the inside. The veg mix was super spot on! The extra hot sauce was freaking amazing and I emptied it! Tahini sauce was